==== hyperbricks yaml {!{main_menu}} ====
home:
  - type: hypermedia
  - route: index
  - title: Home
  - section: main
  - index: 10

about:
  - type: hypermedia
  - route: about
  - title: About
  - section: main
  - index: 20

main_menu:
  - type: menu
  - section: main
  - sort: index
  - order: asc
  - item: '<a href="/{{.Route}}">{{.Title}}</a>'
  - active: '<strong>{{.Title}}</strong>'
  - enclose: '<nav>|</nav>'
==== explainer ====
MENU keeps route metadata separate from the selected menu component; the {!{main_menu}} scope renders the menu.
==== expected json ====
{
  "@type": "<MENU>",
  "active": "<strong>{{.Title}}</strong>",
  "enclose": "<nav>|</nav>",
  "item": "<a href=\"/{{.Route}}\">{{.Title}}</a>",
  "order": "asc",
  "section": "main",
  "sort": "index"
}
==== expected output ====
<nav><strong>Home</strong>
<a href="/about">About</a></nav>
